<title>UK: Reuters' 4th ex-UK Asia/Mideast air cargo report.</title>
<headline>Reuters' 4th ex-UK Asia/Mideast air cargo report.</headline>
<text>
<p>LONDON, March 21 Reuter) - Below are the current average ex-UK to the Middle East/Asia/Australasia GBP air cargo market rates per kg for a 100kg shipment, with a volume-to-weight ratio of six-to-one.</p>
<p>		    March 21	 March 7</p>
<p>		   ASIA-PACIFIC</p>
<p> LON-BKK	   1.11	     1.04</p>
<p> LON-HKG	   1.16	     1.20</p>
<p> LON-JAK	   1.10	     1.10</p>
<p> LON-MNL	   1.40	     1.35</p>
<p> LON-NRT	   1.95	     1.95</p>
<p> LON-SEL	   1.90	     1.92</p>
<p> LON-SIN	   1.19	     1.24</p>
<p> LON-SYD	   2.08	     2.15</p>
<p> LON-TPE	   1.18	     1.15</p>
<p>		  MIDDLE EAST</p>
<p> LON-BAH	   0.90	     0.92</p>
<p> LON-CAI	   0.81	     0.81</p>
<p> LON-DXB	   0.80	     0.80</p>
<p>		 INDIAN SUB-CONTINENT</p>
<p> LON-BOM	   0.73	     0.72</p>
<p> LON-DEL	   0.66	     0.63</p>
<p> LON-KHI	   1.07	     1.05</p>
<p>*The rates quoted in this report were obtained by Reuters journalists on a confidential basis from a range of airlines, large forwarders and smaller air cargo agents based at the three main London airports.</p>
<p>*All prices quoted in sterling per kg.</p>
<p>*The tariffs represent average rates calculated from a range of prices and are indicative or current market activity.</p>
<p>-Reuters Air Cargo Newsroom Tel +44 171 542 7706;  Fax:5017</p>
